<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Éfezu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Éfezu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Éfezu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ef</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo nia surat</para>
  <para style="mt2">ba sarani sira iha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Éfezu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Paulo hahuu nia surat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Surat nee husi hau, Paulo. Maromak rasik mak foti hau sai Kristu Jesus nia apostolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Hau hakerek surat nee ba imi, Maromak nia povu iha sidade Éfezu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Surat Éfezu nee iha kopia barak husi tempu antigu. Kopia balu hakerek “iha Éfezu”, balu lae. </char></note> Imi ida deit ho Kristu Jesus i tuir nafatin Nia ho laran tomak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 18:19-21</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Hau harohan ba ita nia Aman Maromak ho Nai Jesus Kristu para hatudu Sira nia laran diak ba imi, i foo pas ho hakmatek ba imi.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Maromak hatudu Nia laran diak liu husi Jesus Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Mai ita hahii Maromak! Nia mak ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu nia Aman. Nia foo ona bensaun bar-barak husi lalehan mai ita, tanba ita laran ida ona ho Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Molok Maromak halo mundu, Nia hili tiha ona ita sai Kristu nia ema. Nia hakarak atu ita moris ho laran moos iha Nia oin, i livre husi sala. Maromak hadomi ita, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />nee mak Nia desidi ona hori uluk kedas atu foti ita sai Nia oan. Jesus Kristu mak halo Maromak nia desizaun nee sai realidade. Nee hotu tuir Maromak nia hakarak rasik, i halo Nia laran haksolok. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Mai ita hahii adora Nia! Tanba Nia laran diak teb-tebes, i Nia hatudu Nia laran diak nee liu husi Nia Oan doben.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kristu nia raan fakar too mate para selu kotu ita nia tusan hodi foo liberdade mai ita, nee dehan katak ita nia sala hamoos tiha ona. Ho nunee Maromak hatudu Nia laran osan mean mai ita. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kolose 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Nia mos foo matenek klean mai ita hodi loke ita nia neon. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />I Nia planu nebee uluk taka hela ba ita ema, agora Nia hatudu ona mai ita. Nia planu nee, Nia desidi hori uluk ona atu Kristu mak halao. Nia hakarak atu ita hatene katak, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />bainhira too ona nia tempu, Maromak sei halo buat hotu-hotu iha lalehan ho iha rai hamutuk ida deit, i Kristu mak sei ukun hotu-hotu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Hori uluk kedas Maromak hili ami ema Judeu sai Nia povu para ami laran ida ho Kristu. Ida nee tuir Nia planu, i buat nebee Nia desidi ona Nia sempre halo tuir. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Nia hili ami atu ami nebee fiar uluk ba Kristu bele hahii adora Maromak tanba Nia nee Kbiit Nain!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Imi nebee laos ema Judeu mos rona ona Liafuan Diak kona ba Kristu hodi fiar ba Nia. Liafuan nee mak loos, i lori salvasaun ba imi. Bainhira imi fiar ba Kristu, Maromak mos foo Nia Espiritu Santu ba imi tuir Nia promesa uluk. Espiritu Santu nee hanesan sinal ida katak, imi sai tiha ona Kristu nia ema. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Tanba Maromak foo ona Nia Espiritu Santu ba ita mak ita laran metin katak, aban-bainrua Nia sei foo tan buat hotu-hotu nebee Nia promete ona. I ita nebee sai ona Nia povu, Nia sei hasai ita husi ita nia sala hotu. Mai ita hahii adora Maromak tanba Nia nee Kbiit Nain!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo halo orasaun ba sarani sira iha Éfezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Hau rona dehan, imi fiar metin ba Nai Jesus i hadomi Maromak nia povu hotu. Dezde hau rona nunee, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />hau sempre foo agradese ba Maromak tanba imi, i bainhira hau halo orasaun, hau sempre husu atu Maromak tulun imi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Nia mak ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu nia Maromak. Nia mak ita nia Aman ida nebee Kbiit Nain. Hau husu atu Nia Espiritu loke imi nia neon i hatudu Maromak ba imi, para imi bele konhese Maromak diak liu tan. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Hau harohan atu Maromak foo naroman ba imi para imi bele kompriende buat hotu-hotu nebee Nia promete ona atu foo. Imi hein ho laran metin atu simu buat sira nee tanba Nia bolu ona imi sai Nia ema. Hau mos harohan atu imi kompriende katak, bensaun nebee Maromak promete ona atu foo ba Nia povu nee boot teb-tebes.<verse eid="EPH 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Hau harohan atu imi bele hatene Maromak nia kbiit. Nia kbiit nee makaas teb-tebes, boot liu hotu-hotu. Hodi kbiit nee mak Nia tulun ita nebee fiar ba Nia. Hodi kbiit ida nee mos <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Nia halo Kristu moris fali husi mate, i foti Kristu tuur iha Nia sorin loos iha lalehan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Salmu 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kristu boot liu buat hotu-hotu iha lalehan ho rai. Nia boot liu nai ulun sira, autoridade sira ho espiritu bo-boot sira hotu. Nia naran aas liu see-see deit mak kaer ukun, laos deit sira nebee ukun agora, maibee mos sira nebee sei ukun aban-bainrua. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Maromak halo buat hotu-hotu hakruuk ba Kristu, i foti Kristu sai Ulun hodi ukun buat hotu-hotu, atu nunee Nia bele tulun Nia povu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Salmu 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Kristu mak Ulun, i ita sarani sira hanesan Nia isin lolon. Ita simu ita nia moris tomak husi Kristu, nunee mos Kristu foo moris ba buat hotu-hotu iha lalehan ho rai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kolose 1:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nai Maromak salva ita tanba Nia laran diak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Uluk imi hanesan mate tiha ona, tanba imi kontra Maromak nia lei i halo sala oi-oin. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Iha tempu nebaa imi moris tuir mundu nia hakarak i tuir Satanás nia hakarak. Satanás mak ukun espiritu aat sira, i agora nia servisu hela iha ema sira nebee lakohi tuir Maromak. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Uluk ita hotu moris nunee. Ita halo buat aat saida deit mak ita kaan atu halo, i tuir deit ita nia hakarak ho hanoin nebee aat. Tanba nee, Maromak atu kastigu ona ita, hanesan mos Nia atu kastigu ema aat sira seluk.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Maibee Maromak hadomi loos ita i hatudu Nia laran luak mai ita. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Maski ita hanesan mate tiha ona tanba ita nia sala, maibee Nia halo ita moris fali ona hamutuk ho Kristu. Tanba deit Maromak nia laran diak mak Nia salva ita.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Kolose 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Maromak halo moris fali ita hamutuk ho Kristu Jesus i foti ona ita tuur hamutuk ho Nia iha lalehan. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Maromak halo nunee para iha tempu oin mai Nia bele hatudu sai Nia laran diak mai ita liu husi Kristu Jesus. Nunee ita ema bele hatene Nia domin nebee boot teb-tebes, ita sukat la bele. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Maromak salva imi bainhira imi fiar ba Kristu. Nia salva imi tanba Nia laran diak, laos tanba imi nia diak. Salvasaun nee, Nia foo saugati deit, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />laos tanba imi nia hahalok diak. Entaun imi ida la bele gaba aan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tito 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ita nee Maromak nia liman fatin. I Kristu Jesus foo moris foun mai ita para ita bele halao buat nebee diak iha ita nia moris loro-loron. Buat diak sira nee, Maromak prepara tiha ona ba ita hori uluk kedas.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus Kristu halo ita sai ida deit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Imi nebee laos Judeu, imi hatene katak, uluk ema Judeu sira la konsidera imi tanba imi la sunat tuir lei relijiaun Judeu nian.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ema Judeu sira halo serimonia sunat ba labarik mane hotu-hotu bainhira sira halo loron walu. Nee sinal ida hodi hatudu katak labarik nee Maromak nian, i tama ona ba Maromak nia povu.</char></note> Afinal sunat nee, ema mak halo iha isin lolon deit, nee la muda ema nia laran. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Keta haluha, iha tempu nebaa imi dook husi Kristu. Imi hanesan ema lao rai, la iha direitu atu halo parte iha Maromak nia povu Israel, i la tama iha promesa nebee Maromak halo ba sira. Imi hela iha mundu nee, la iha relasaun ida ho Maromak, i la iha esperansa. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Maski iha tempu nebaa imi dook husi Maromak, maibee agora imi laran ida ho Kristu Jesus. Nunee Maromak halo ona imi besik malu ho Nia, tanba Kristu nia raan fakar too mate ba imi.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Uluk ami ema Judeu ho imi nebee laos Judeu odi malu, nee hanesan moru ida haketak ita. Maibee agora Kristu rasik halo ita dame malu ona. Nia halo rahun tiha moru nee hodi halo ita hotu sai povu ida. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Uluk lei relijiaun Judeu ho nia regra bar-barak haketak ema Judeu husi ema seluk. Maibee liu husi Kristu nia mate, Nia halo sistema lei nee la vale ona, atu nunee ema Judeu ho ema nebee laos Judeu hamutuk laran ida ho Nia. Ho nunee Kristu halo povu rua nee sai povu ida nebee moris iha dame nia laran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kolose 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Entaun Kristu mate iha krus halo povu rua nee sai ida deit, i halo ita mos dame malu ho Maromak, tanba Kristu harahun tiha ona buat hotu-hotu nebee uluk halo ita odi malu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kolose 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Kristu mai iha mundu hodi foo sai kona ba dame ba imi nebee uluk dook husi Maromak, ho mos ba ami ema Judeu nebee besik Nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isaias 57:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Kristu loke ona dalan ba ita hotu too ba iha Aman Maromak nia futar oin. Atu ita ema Judeu ka laos Judeu, Maromak nia Espiritu tulun ita hotu atu bele hakbesik aan ba Maromak.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristu nia povu hanesan uma santu ida ba Nai Maromak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Entaun, maski uluk imi hanesan ema lao rai i la halo parte iha Maromak nia povu, maibee agora imi sai ona ema rai nain hamutuk ho Nia povu sira seluk. Imi mos sai ona Maromak nia familia uma laran. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Nee hanesan Maromak harii uma ida. Kristu Jesus hanesan fatuk prinsipal liu iha uma nee. Nia apostolu sira ho profeta sira nebee tatoli Nia liafuan mak hanesan fatuk nebee Maromak hada nudar alsesu. Depois Nia hada mos imi hamutuk iha fatuk sira nee nia leten. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Kristu mak halo uma nee hamriik metin i sae ba beibeik, too sai uma kreda santu ida para ita nia Nai hodi hela. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Entaun, tanba imi laran ida ona ho Kristu, Maromak hada mos imi nebee laos Judeu hamutuk ho Nia ema sira seluk, para ita hotu sai Maromak nia Espiritu nia hela fatin.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Paulo lori Liafuan Diak ba ema nebee laos Judeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Hau, Paulo agora dadauk dadur hela iha komarka tanba hau halao servisu nebee Kristu Jesus foo mai hau. Servisu nee mak foo sai Liafuan Diak ba imi nebee laos Judeu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Imi rona ona katak, Maromak foo fiar mai hau halo servisu nee ba imi tanba Nia laran diak mai hau. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Nia foo sai ona Nia planu segredu mai hau, hanesan hau hakerek tiha ona uitoan iha leten. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Bainhira imi lee ona ida nee, imi sei hatene katak hau kompriende Maromak nia planu kona ba Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Uluk segredu nee seidauk foo sai ba ema ida. Maibee agora Maromak foo sai ona liu husi Nia Espiritu ba Nia apostolu sira ho profeta sira. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Segredu nee mak nee: Se ema nebee laos Judeu fiar ba Liafuan Diak, entaun sira sei simu bensaun nebee Maromak foo ba Nia oan sira, hanesan mos ema Judeu. Sira ho ema Judeu hamutuk sai povu ida, nee hanesan sira halo parte iha isin lolon ida deit. Sira hotu simu buat nebee mak Maromak promete ona ba Nia povu tanba sira laran ida ho Kristu Jesus.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Maromak hatudu Nia laran diak mai hau hodi hili hau foo sai Liafuan Diak. I Nia foo Nia kbiit mai hau para halao servisu nee. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Husi Maromak nia ema hotu-hotu, hau mak kiik liu. Maski nunee Maromak foo fiar mai hau para foo hatene ba ema nebee laos Judeu kona ba bensaun boot nebee Kristu foo mai ita. Nia bensaun nee, ita sukat la too. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Desde Maromak halo mundu, Maromak nia planu segredu hela. Maibee agora Nia haruka hau esplika ba ema hotu-hotu kona ba oinsaa mak Nia atu halao Nia planu nee. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Liu husi Nia povu, Maromak hakarak hatudu Nia matenek klean teb-tebes para espiritu bo-boot sira nebee kaer ukun bele haree. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Maromak sei halo buat sira nee hotu tuir planu nebee Nia desidi tiha ona molok Nia halo mundu. I Nia foo planu nee ba Kristu Jesus ita nia Nai mak halao. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ita nebee fiar ona ba Kristu i laran ida ho Nia, la bele tauk atu hakbesik aan ba iha Maromak, tanba odamatan sempre nakloke ba ita. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Tanba nee, hau husu ba imi, maski hau hetan terus tanba hau serbi imi nebee laos Judeu, maibee keta laran susar. Tanba hau nia terus nee lori diak ba imi.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo halo orasaun ba sarani sira iha Éfezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Bainhira hau hanoin Maromak nia planu furak nee, hau hakneak hodi halo orasaun ba Aman Maromak. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Nia mak Aman ba familia hotu-hotu iha lalehan ho rai. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Maromak nia kbiit boot teb-tebes. Nunee Hau harohan atu Nia Espiritu foo kbiit ba imi hodi hametin imi nia laran. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Hau harohan atu Kristu hela metin iha imi nia laran, tanba imi fiar ba Nia. Hau mos harohan atu domin sai huun ba imi nia moris para imi sai hanesan ai huun nebee hamriik metin tanba nia abut tama klean ba rai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:7">Kolose 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18-19" />Se nunee, imi hamutuk ho Maromak nia povu sira hotu bele kompriende Kristu nia domin, maski ita ema nunka bele kompriende. Tanba Nia domin nee boot teb-tebes, luan teb-tebes, aas teb-tebes i klean teb-tebes. Hau harohan atu imi bele hatene lo-loos Kristu nia domin nee, atu nunee imi bele hatudu Maromak nia diak ho Nia domin iha imi nia moris tomak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:19">Kolose 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="COL 2:9-10">2:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 3:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Maromak nia kbiit makaas teb-tebes. Nia bele halo liu fali saida deit mak ita husu ba Nia, i bele halo liu fali saida deit mak ita bele hanoin. Hodi Nia kbiit boot nee mak Nia servisu iha ita nia laran. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Mai ita hahii adora Nia, tanba Nia kbiit nebee Nia hatudu ba Nia povu liu husi Kristu Jesus. Mai ita hahii adora Nia, husi jerasaun ba jerasaun, too tinan ba tinan. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kristu nia povu sai ida deit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Hau dadur hela tanba serbi ita nia Nai. Nunee hau husu boot atu imi bele moris tuir Maromak nia hakarak, tanba Nia bolu ona imi sai Nia ema. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Imi tenki moris haraik aan, laran maus, pasiensia ba malu, i hadomi malu. Se ema ruma halo sala hasoru imi, lalika lori ba lia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kolose 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Espiritu Santu foo ona unidade ba imi. Nee duni hakaas aan atu moris iha dame nia laran, para imi nia unidade nee bele metin nafatin. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ita hamutuk halo parte iha isin lolon ida deit. Ita hotu simu ona Maromak nia Espiritu, Espiritu nee ida deit. Maromak bolu ona ita hotu sai Nia ema, entaun ita nia esperansa ba aban-bainrua mos hanesan. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ita nia Nai ida deit, ita nia fiar ida deit, i ita hotu simu batizmu ida deit. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Maromak ida deit, Nia mak ita hotu nia Aman. Nia ukun ita hotu-hotu, Nia halao Nia servisu liu husi ita hotu-hotu, i Nia hela iha ita hotu nia laran.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristu foo knaar oi-oin atu Nia povu sai forti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Maski ita hotu ida deit, maibee Kristu fahe kbiit mai ita ida-idak para bele halao Nia servisu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Nee tuir buat nebee hakerek tiha ona iha Livru Sagradu dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Bainhira Nia sae ba iha fatin aas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Nia lori inimigu sira nebee Nia hadau iha funu laran,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EPH 4:8">i Nia fahe prezenti oi-oin ba Nia ema.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Salmu 68:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Liafuan “Nia sae” nee dehan saida? Nee dehan katak, uluk Nia tuun tiha ona mai iha mundu, iha fatin nebee kraik liu. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ida nebee tuun mai nee, Ida nee mak sae fila fali ba lalehan, iha fatin nebee aas liu, atu nunee fatin nebee-nebee deit, Nia prezensa nakonu iha nebaa. Nia nee mak Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Kristu mak foo kbiit ba Nia ema, atu sira halao servisu nebee Nia fahe ba sira. Nia foti balu sai apostolu. Balu Nia foti sai profeta para tatoli Nia liafuan, balu sai ema nebee foo sai Nia Liafuan Diak ba ema nebee seidauk rona, i balu fali sai bibi atan ho mestri hodi tau matan ba Nia povu i hanorin sira. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Nia foti sira nee para sira bele prepara Maromak nia povu atu ita hotu-hotu halao Nia servisu. Ho nunee ita hotu, nudar Kristu nia isin lolon, sai forti ba beibeik, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13-14" />too ita hotu neon ida laran ida fiar ba Maromak nia Oan i konhese di-diak Nia. Too ikus ita laos hanesan labarik tan, maibee sai boot ona, too ita sai hanesan lo-loos Kristu. Entaun, ita nia fiar la nakdoko ona hanesan laloran nebee anin huu ba-mai. Ema bosok-teen mai inventa tuun-sae hanorin buat nebee la loos mos, ita la tuir, ita la monu ba sira nia lia bosok. <verse eid="EPH 4:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Maibee ita so koalia buat nebee loos hodi hatudu domin ba malu. Se ita halo nunee, neineik-neineik ita sai hanesan Kristu iha ita nia moris tomak. Kristu nee mak Ulun. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />I ita hanesan Nia isin lolon. Nia tau ita ida-idak tuir nia fatin, i halo ita hotu iha ligasaun ba malu. Se ita hadomi malu i ida-idak halao nia knaar mak ita hamutuk boot ba dadauk i sai forti.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kolose 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Husik tiha moris uluk nian hodi moris tuir Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Rona di-diak saida mak hau atu hatete agora, tanba hau koalia hodi Nai Jesus nia naran. Imi la bele moris tan hanesan ema nebee la fiar Maromak. Tanba sira nia hanoin arbiru deit. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Sira nia neon nakukun tiha ona. Sira moris dook husi Maromak, tanba sira ulun toos, i lakohi hatene Maromak nia dalan. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Sira la iha ona moe. Nee mak sira nia moris hanesan animal. Sira foo sira nia aan ba hahalok aat, i sempre hakarak atu halo sala tan.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Maibee bainhira imi aprende kona ba Kristu, imi nunka aprende atu moris aat hanesan nee! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Tanba hau hatene katak, ema nebee uluk hanorin imi kona ba Kristu, hanorin buat nebee mak loos. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Uluk imi hakarak halo buat aat oi-oin, i imi nia hakarak nee lohi imi, too estraga imi nia aan. Maibee ema nebee hanorin imi kona ba Kristu, sira haruka imi husik tiha imi nia moris uluk nee,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kolose 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />i foo fatin ba Maromak para halo foun imi nia neon ho laran. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Imi nia moris tomak tenki sai foun, tanba Maromak halo imi sai foun tiha ona para imi bele moris loos ho laran moos hanesan Nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Jénesis 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Kolose 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:1-2">Roma 12:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nee duni la bele bosok tan. Imi koalia ba malu, tenki koalia loos, tanba ita hotu halo parte iha isin lolon ida.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zacarias 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Se imi hirus, keta husik hirus nee lori imi ba sala, i la bele rai hirus too loro matan monu,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Salmu 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />atu nunee imi la foo fatin ba diabu.<verse eid="EPH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Ema nebee naok-teen, la bele naok tan ona. Maibee nia tenki servisu ho nia liman rasik atu nia bele iha buat ruma para fahe ba ema kiak sira.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Bainhira imi koalia, la bele koalia liafuan aat. Maibee koalia deit liafuan diak nebee ema presiza rona, para hametin sira nia laran, atu nunee imi nia liafuan bele ajuda sira.<verse eid="EPH 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />La bele halo Maromak nia Espiritu Santu tristi. Tanba Espiritu Santu nee Maromak foo hanesan marka ida hodi hatudu katak, imi nee Maromak nian i loron ida Maromak sei hasai imi husi imi nia sala hotu.<verse eid="EPH 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />La bele ona rai odi ba ema. La bele hirus. La bele hakilar ema. La bele istori malu. La bele hatete aat ema. I la bele halo buat aat saida deit. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Maibee imi tenki hadomi malu, i halo diak ba malu. Imi tenki foo perdaun ba malu, hanesan Maromak mos foo ona perdaun ba imi liu husi Kristu nia mate.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kolose 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Moris tuir Maromak nia ezemplu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Imi Maromak nia oan doben. Nee duni moris tuir Nia ezemplu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Moris iha domin nia laran, hanesan mos Kristu hadomi ita, too Nia foo Aan ba mate hodi troka ita. Ho Nia mate nee Nia sai hanesan sakrifisiu morin nebee halo haksolok Maromak nia laran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Ézodu 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Salmu 40:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Imi Maromak nia ema. Nee duni la bele halo sala seksual. Atu hanoin deit hahalok foer sira nee mos, la bele. La bele kaan ema nia sasaan. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />La bele tolok, ka koalia nar-naran, ka konta liafuan aat, tanba buat sira nee la serve atu Maromak nia ema koalia. Maibee foo agradese ba Maromak. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Hanoin di-diak! Ema nebee halo sala seksual ka halo sala foer ka kaan ema nia sasaan, sira sei la halo parte iha Kristu ho Maromak nia reinu. Tanba sira adora buat sira nee hanesan fali sira nia maromak.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Karik ema ruma lohi imi dehan sala sira nee la buat ida, keta fiar. Tanba hahalok aat sira nee halo Maromak hirus teb-tebes hodi foo kastigu ba ema nebee la tuir Nia hakarak. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nee duni la bele liga ema nebee moris hanesan nee.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Uluk imi moris iha nakukun laran. Maibee agora, imi laran ida ho Nai Jesus i tama ona iha naroman. Nee mak imi tenki moris hanesan ema naroman nian. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Ema nebee moris iha naroman, nia sei halo buat diak, moris loos, i koalia loos. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Hakaas aan buka hatene oinsaa mak imi bele halo haksolok Nai Maromak nia laran. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11-12" />La bele halo parte iha hahalok nakukun nian, hahalok aat nee la iha folin ida. Buat nebee ema halo sub-subar nee aat teb-tebes, ita atu koalia mos, ita moe. Diak liu imi hatete sai katak hahalok nakukun nian nee sala. <verse eid="EPH 5:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Nee hanesan naroman leno buat nebee iha nakukun laran, atu ema bele haree buat hotu ho mo-moos. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Tanba naroman halo buat hotu-hotu sai klaru. Iha kantiku ida dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Imi nebee dukur, hadeer ona ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">imi nebee mate, moris fali ona ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">I Kristu sei foo naroman ba imi.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Husik Espiritu Santu domina imi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Tanba nee, kuidadu di-diak imi nia moris. La bele moris hanesan ema beik, maibee tenki moris hanesan ema matenek. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Ohin loron ema barak halo buat aat. Nee duni kuandu iha oportunidade saida deit para halo diak ba ema, halo ona ba.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kolose 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Keta beik-teen, maibee hakaas aan atu kompriende saida mak ita nia Nai hakarak.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />La bele tua lanu. Se lae, tua nee mak domina fali imi too imi halo buat aat oi-oin. Maibee husik Espiritu Santu mak domina imi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Bainhira imi koalia ba malu, temi liafuan husi hananu oi-oin, hanesan husi livru Salmus, kanta nebee Espiritu Santu foo, ho hananu seluk nebee adora Maromak. Hananu hahii ita nia Nai ho laran tomak. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Iha situasaun saida deit, sempre agradese ba Aman Maromak ba buat hotu-hotu hodi ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu nia naran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kolose 3:16-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Imi hotu-hotu tenki hakruuk ba malu tanba imi respeita Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feen ho laen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Imi feen sira, hakruuk ba imi nia laen, hanesan mos imi hakruuk ba Nai Jesus. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Kolose 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pedro 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Tanba laen nudar ulun ba nia feen, hanesan mos Kristu mak Ulun ba Nia povu. Nia povu hanesan Nia isin lolon, i Nia mak salva sira. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Kristu nia povu hakruuk ba Nia. Nunee mos, feen sira tenki hakruuk ba sira nia laen iha buat hotu-hotu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Imi laen sira mos tenki hadomi imi nia feen, hanesan Kristu hadomi Nia povu, too Nia entrega Nia Aan ba mate iha sira nia fatin,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Kolose 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pedro 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />para halo sira moris ho laran moos. Nia fase moos sira nia laran bainhira sira rona Nia liafuan i sarani ho bee. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Kristu halo nunee para Nia bele aprezenta Nia povu ba Nia Aan rasik hanesan feto raan ida nebee kapaas teb-tebes. Sira la iha foer ka noda i la namkurut, maibee laran moos i livre husi sala.<verse eid="EPH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Nunee mos, imi laen sira tenki hadomi imi nia feen hanesan imi hadomi imi nia isin lolon rasik. See mak hadomi nia feen, nia hadomi nia aan. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />La iha ema ida odi nia aan, maibee nia foo haan i kuidadu di-diak, hanesan Kristu mos kuidadu Nia povu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />tanba ita hanesan Nia isin lolon. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, “Tanba nee, mane tenki husik nia inan-aman, para baa moris laran ida ho nia feen, i sira nain rua sai ona ida.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jénesis 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Liafuan nee klean teb-tebes, i tuir hau haree, hatudu mos ba Kristu ho Nia povu. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nee duni laen ida-idak tenki hadomi nia feen hanesan nia hadomi nia aan rasik. I feen ida-idak mos tenki respeita nia laen.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Oan ho inan-aman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Oan sira, nudar ema nebee tuir Nai Jesus, imi tenki rona imi nia inan-aman, tanba hahalok ida nee mak loos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Kolose 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Husi ukun fuan sanulu, iha ida dehan, “O tenki respeita o nia inan-aman.” Husi ukun fuan sira nee, too iha ida nee mak Maromak foin foo promesa ba ema nebee halo tuir. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Nia promete dehan, “Se halo nunee, o sei moris diak i hetan vida naruk iha rai nee.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ézodu 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deuteronómiu 5:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Aman sira, la bele siak hela deit imi nia oan sira halo sira laran moras. Maibee tau matan di-diak ba sira husi kiik kedas hodi hanorin sira i foo hanoin ba sira tuir ita nia Nai nia hakarak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Kolose 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atan ho patraun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Atan sira, imi tenki halo tuir orden nebee imi nia patraun iha mundu nee foo ba imi, hanesan imi halo tuir Kristu nia hakarak. Imi tenki respeita sira, rona sira, i servisu ba sira ho laran. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Nudar Kristu nia atan, imi la bele servisu hodi buka oin deit. Atu patraun iha ka la iha, imi tenki servisu ho lo-loos hodi halo tuir Maromak nia hakarak ho laran tomak. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Halo imi nia servisu ho haksolok, hanesan imi serbi ba Nai Jesus, laos ba ema deit. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Keta haluha katak, atu atan ka laos atan, se ita halo diak, aban-bainrua ita nia Nai sei selu fali ita nia kolen tuir buat diak nebee ita halo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-24">Kolose 3:22-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Patraun sira, imi mos tenki haree imi nia atan sira ho diak. La bele ameasa sira. Tanba imi hatene katak, sira ho imi iha Patraun ida deit iha lalehan, i Patraun nee la fihir oin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deuteronómiu 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kolose 3:25</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:1">4:1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Tiago 5:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uza ekipamentu funu tomak nebee Nai Maromak foo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Hau nia liafuan ikus mak nee: Sai forti ba! Tanba imi laran ida ho ita nia Nai, i Nia kbiit makaas teb-tebes foo forsa mai ita. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Imi tenki uza ekipamentu funu nian kompletu nebee Maromak foo ba imi, para imi bele hamriik metin hodi hasoru diabu nia manobra. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Tanba ita funu, laos hasoru ema. Maibee ita funu hasoru diabu bo-boot nebee ita la haree ho matan, hasoru espiritu aat oi-oin nebee ukun iha nakukun laran. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nee duni imi tenki uza ekipamentu funu nian tomak nebee Maromak foo. Nunee bainhira loron aat nee too mai, imi bele tuba rai metin. I kuandu imi funu hotu ona, imi sei hamriik metin nafatin.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Entaun, hamriik metin ba. Kaer metin lia loos, nee hanesan imi kesi sintu iha imi nia kanotak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuandu tropas Roma sira atu baa funu, sira kesi sintu para sira nia hena la bele atrapalha sira.</char></note> Moris loos, nee hanesan imi taka besi belar iha hirus matan para defende aan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isaias 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Imi tenki prontu foo sai Liafuan Diak kona ba oinsaa bele dame malu ho Maromak, nee hanesan imi tau sapatu tropas nian.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isaias 52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Imi mos tenki kaer metin nafatin imi nia fiar ba Jesus, nee hanesan imi kaer besi kabelak hodi defende imi nia aan. Nunee bainhira Satanás hana rama ahi ba imi, la borus, i ahi nee mate kedas. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Laran metin ba, katak Maromak salva tiha ona imi, nee hanesan imi taka kapaseti besi. Kaer metin Maromak nia liafuan, nee hanesan surik ida nebee Espiritu Santu foo ba imi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isaias 59:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Halo orasaun loron-kalan ho Espiritu Santu nia tulun. Iha situasaun saida deit, husu Maromak nia ajuda. Matan moris neon nain nafatin, i sempre halo orasaun ba Maromak nia povu hotu-hotu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Keta haluha halo orasaun mos mai hau, para bainhira hau loke hau nia ibun, Maromak foo liafuan mai hau, atu hau bele foo sai segredu Liafuan Diak nian ho brani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:4">Kolose 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Jesus foti hau sai Nia embaixador para foo sai Liafuan Diak nee. Tanba nee mak agora hau dadur hela iha kadeia. Nee duni harohan mai hau, atu hau bele foo sai Nia Liafuan ho brani, tanba ida nee mak hau nia obrigasaun duni.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo taka nia surat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Hau haruka Tíkiku ba imi, para konta buat hotu-hotu kona ba hau, atu imi bele hatene kona ba hau nia situasaun ho hau nia servisu. Tíkiku nee ita nia irmaun doben, i nia badinas halao ita nia Nai nia servisu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Timóteo 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Hau haruka nia ba imi, atu nia bele konta kona ba ami nia moris iha nee, i bele hametin imi nia laran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kolose 4:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Maun-alin sira, hau harohan ba ita nia Aman Maromak ho Jesus Kristu ita nia Nai, para Sira foo pas ho hakmatek ba imi, i tulun imi atu hadomi malu i fiar nafatin ba Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Hau mos harohan atu Maromak hatudu Nia laran diak ba ema hotu-hotu nebee hadomi ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu ho domin ida nebee la iha rohan.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>